  {
   "rating": 1,
   "date": "2026-10-06T18:34:20-05:00",
   "body": "Did this as a Gnome for fun. The pelts were not that easy to collect, as their drop rate isn't stellar and the spawn rates of kitty cats in the zone aren't crazy.\r\n\r\nThe pelts only drop from the level [b]5-6 Nightsabers[/b]. Don't bother with the [npc=2043] nearby. Instead, [b]zig zag up and down east of Dolanaar[/b] and skip the furbolg village. This is how I did it, at least. Worth the trouble for a [b]6-slot bag[/b]!",
   "replies": []
  }
 ]
